<title>POLAND: Polfa Kutno revises up H1 net profit.</title>
<headline>Polfa Kutno revises up H1 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polfa Kutno results for the first six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						H1 96	  H1 95</p>
<p>    operating			     14.92   vs   10.25</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 14.83   vs    8.41</p>
<p>    net					9.75   vs    5.49</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Polfa Kutno SA. Earlier the company has reported its net profit at 8.8 million zlotys. @</p>
<p>    net sales			     86.59   vs   74.66</p>
<p>    costs of sales			57.28   vs   55.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    income tax			     5.08   vs    2.92</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  17.50   vs    0.67</p>
<p>    financial costs		     17.59   vs    2.50</p>
<p>    investment			    47.17   vs    5.14</p>
<p>    depreciation			   2.89   vs    2.28</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 970.</p>
</text>
